          "description": "One entry per unordered task pair, each carrying its explicit left and right task IDs. Endpoint distinctness (left != right) and pair completeness (all N-choose-2) are evaluator consistency checks \u2014 not expressible as a value comparison in JSON Schema draft 2020-12; the restructuring to an explicit list removes the string-key/endpoint disagreement class by construction.",
